## Commands

### Structurizr CLI

```bash
# Validate DSL
structurizr validate -workspace diagrams/c4/workspace.dsl

# Export to PNG
structurizr export -workspace diagrams/c4/workspace.dsl -format png -output diagrams/artefacts/c4

# Export to SVG
